{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "init:i1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Initially, it is important to check the Referee Reports."
      ],
      "justification": "Process initiation mapped to opening statement."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "monitor if the Referee Reports have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of the monitoring/check step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have been completed, you can proceed with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Decision branch and positive guard for completion condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n3",
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "if they have not been completed, you should flag it and send a reminder."
      ],
      "justification": "Negative guard and corresponding action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, you should check again if the Referee Reports have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Re-check step after initial reminder."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have, you can continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Second decision branch and positive guard."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n15",
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, you should flag it again and send another reminder."
      ],
      "justification": "Negative guard and action for incomplete status on second check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "converge:c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have, you can continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Structural convergence merging paths after report checks."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the Referee Reports have been completed, you can move on to organizing interviews for the Selection Panel with the top candidates."
      ],
      "justification": "Step split into two equivalent actions; redundancy does not change behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the interviews, it is necessary to receive feedback from the interview candidates."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, you need to check if a Psychometric Test is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Check step and associated decision point."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->c2",
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, you can continue with the process and coordinate the second round of selection."
      ],
      "justification": "Negative path guard and corresponding action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is, you should then check if an HR Specialist is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Positive path guard leads to nested check step and second branch."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n11",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If an HR Specialist is required, you should schedule the test with a third party."
      ],
      "justification": "Nested positive guard and scheduling action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Otherwise, you can proceed to complete the Psychometric Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Nested negative guard and test completion action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, you should request the final candidate ranking and continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Final step matching source content."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "end:e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, you should request the final candidate ranking and continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit process termination following the final step."
    }
  ],
